s.\nTeleport: Quick warp to key locations (keep in mind it might be a bit unstable depending on your ping or game state).\nESP: For basic player tracking.\nServer Hop: A simple tool to hop into a smaller server (4-9 players).\nFeel free to try it out if you’d like. It’s a work in progress, so if you encounter any bugs or have suggestions on how I can improve it, let me know! Feedback is always welcome. Thanks! 🔥🔥🔥🔥🔥","tags":["Script"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"69e184f3424f482a3ebed48b","username":"Catgoo782","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/74c65da4547b57bf515b2a40247c61a6e7f1b8d9a68659981067642f09d867ba.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69e184f3424f482a3ebed48b-1784314913718.jpg"},"lvl":4,"status":"offline","id":"69e184f3424f482a3ebed48b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/74c65da4547b57bf515b2a40247c61a6e7f1b8d9a68659981067642f09d867ba.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69e184f3424f482a3ebed48b-1784314913718.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-24T02:27:27.472Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a5a7aeaf5a231b48de56ba9","editBy":{"_id":"69e184f3424f482a3ebed48b","username":"Catgoo782","status":"offline","id":"69e184f3424f482a3ebed48b"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-07-17T18:56:42.299Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6a6250c83b49a1bd4a955fd5","commentBy":{"_id":"6968ff08f87102127f3850f8","username":"maittomiovarris","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original":null},"lastActive":"2026-10-04T09:11:22.010Z","createdAt":"2026-01-15T14:51:52.186Z","status":"offline","id":"6968ff08f87102127f3850f8","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-p